    public function releaseContact(int $id,int $adminId): void{$this->db->transaction(function(Database $db)use($id,$adminId):void{$order=$db->fetch('SELECT * FROM orders WHERE id=:id FOR UPDATE',['id'=>$id]);$assignment=$order&&!empty($order['current_assignment_id'])?$db->fetch('SELECT a.*,w.user_id FROM assignments a INNER JOIN worker_profiles w ON w.id=a.worker_id WHERE a.id=:id FOR UPDATE',['id'=>$order['current_assignment_id']]):null;if(!$order||$order['lifecycle_status']!=='active'||!$assignment||$order['payment_status']!=='paid'||$assignment['status']!=='accepted')throw new RuntimeException('需先确认预约费到账且师傅已经接单，才能开放完整信息。');$db->execute("INSERT INTO order_role_grants(order_id,user_id,grant_type,scope_json,status,granted_by_admin_id,created_at) VALUES(:order,:user,'full_contact',:scope,'active',:admin,NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE scope_json=VALUES(scope_json),status='active',granted_by_admin_id=VALUES(granted_by_admin_id),revoked_at=NULL",['order'=>$id,'user'=>$assignment['user_id'],'scope'=>json_encode(['contact'=>true,'address'=>true],JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE),'admin'=>$adminId]);$db->execute("UPDATE orders SET assignment_status='info_released',contact_revealed_at=NOW(),updated_at=NOW(),version=version+1 WHERE id=:id",['id'=>$id]);$this->events->record($id,'contact_revealed',$adminId,'管理员向已接单师傅开放完整联系信息');});}
    private function categories(array $in): array{$raw=$in['category_ids']??($in['category_id']??[]);if(!is_array($raw))$raw=[$raw];$ids=array_values(array_unique(array_filter(array_map('intval',$raw))));if(!$ids)return[];$marks=[];$params=[];foreach($ids as $i=>$id){$marks[]=':c'.$i;$params['c'.$i]=$id;}$rows=$this->db->fetchAll("SELECT id,name,order_code FROM service_categories WHERE parent_id IS NULL AND status='active' AND id IN (".implode(',',$marks).')',$params);$by=[];foreach($rows as$r)$by[(int)$r['id']]=$r;$out=[];foreach($ids as$id)if(isset($by[$id]))$out[]=$by[$id];return$out;}
    private function syncCategories(Database $db,int $id,array $cats): void{$db->execute('DELETE FROM order_categories WHERE order_id=:id',['id'=>$id]);foreach($cats as$i=>$cat)$db->insert('INSERT INTO order_categories(order_id,category_id,sort_order,created_at) VALUES(:order,:category,:sort,NOW())',['order'=>$id,'category'=>$cat['id'],'sort'=>$i]);}
    private function utcDate(string $value): ?string{if(trim($value)==='')return null;try{$d=new DateTime($value,new DateTimeZone((string)\app_config('app.timezone','Asia/Shanghai')));$d->setTimezone(new DateTimeZone('UTC'));return$d->format('Y-m-d H:i:s');}catch(\Exception $e){throw new RuntimeException('期望上门时间格式不正确。');}}
    private function terminal(string $status): bool{return in_array($status,['cancelled','completed','closed','cancel_approved_pending_refund','refunded'],true);}
}
